L</given-names></name><name><surname>Thieffry</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Alvarez-Buylla</surname><given-names>ER</given-names></name></person-group><year>1999</year><article-title>Genetic control of flower morphogenesis in <named-content content-type="genus-species">Arabidopsis thaliana</named-content>: A logical analysis</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><volume>15</volume><fpage>593</fpage><lpage>606</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10487867</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030163-b017"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Albert</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Othmer</surname><given-names>HG</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>The topology of the regulatory interactions predicts the expression pattern of the <italic>Drosophila</italic> segment polarity genes</article-title><source>J Theor Biology</source><volume>223</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>18</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030163-b018"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chaves</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Albert</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Sontag</surname><given-names>ED</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Robustness and fragility of Boolean models for genetic regulatory networks</article-title><source>J Theor Biol</source><volume>235</volume><fpage>431</fpage><lpage>449</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15882705</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030163-b019"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Benjamini</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Coico</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Sunshine</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><source>Immunology&#x02014;A 